do_2 = "Add this standalone sentence in the same section: For `v7.0`, `--plan-info` is required, validated and forwarded to the node upgrade files. This describes the requirement at tools/release/rehearse-v6120.sh:189, validation at tools/release/rehearse-v6120.sh:240 and forwarding at tools/release/rehearse-v6120.sh:259, consistent with docs/release/7.0.0-upgrade-plan.md:253."
do_3 = "Remove the obsolete sentence This rehearsal does not prove a different upgrade plan. at RELEASE.md:149, retain the isolated rollback and feed-service instructions at RELEASE.md:146, and keep candidate rehearsal evidence requirements intact."
do_4 = "Use the focused documentation grep to require both corrected sentences within Rehearsing the upgrade and reject both obsolete plan restrictions in that section; no script or existing test changes are needed."
